:''This article is about the enemy. For the Cat Unit, see [[Mousse (Duck) (Uber Rare Cat)|Mousse (Duck)]].''

'''Mousse''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Ranma 1/2 Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 10.4 Update|Version 10.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Mousse
|image = E 546.png
|money drop = 1,900¢ - 7,990¢
|appearance = [[Ranma 1/2 Collaboration Event]]
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has extremely low DPS, but a 100% chance to [[Weaken]] cats to 50% for 4 seconds and an insanely long attack range.

==Strategy==
Mousse has enough range to outrange almost any cat in the game, but his attack power and attack rate are slow enough that it doesn't matter too much. [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|Rushers]] like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] or [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Express Cat]] can do good damage to it, and any unit that can tank their attacks for a long time while dealing damage is also a good choice.

